<title>UK: M.A.I.D &quot;comfortable&quot; with H2 profit forecast.</title>
<headline>M.A.I.D &quot;comfortable&quot; with H2 profit forecast.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Electronic information provider M.A.I.D Plc  MAID.O is confident that it can meet analysts' profit forecasts for 1997, chief executive Dan Wagner said on Thursday.</p>
<p>&quot;The analysts expect a significant profit in the third and fourth quarter. We're very comfortable with those forecasts,&quot; Wagner told Reuters.</p>
</text>
